  "truth_and_safety_invariants": [
    "No simulated observation may be represented as live.",
    "No estimated cost or duration may be represented as measured.",
    "No attempted operation may be represented as observed.",
    "No observed operation may be represented as verified without admitted verifier evidence.",
    "No stored proof blob may be treated as an admitted or reusable proof.",
    "No cache entry may be reused unless it binds the exact repository, tree, objective revision, policy revision, interface and schema versions, toolchain, and relevant environment.",
    "No stale lease or fencing token may complete a task.",
    "No unknown provider outcome may be automatically retried as though no external effect occurred.",
    "No controller may mutate task state outside the canonical state-transition authority.",
    "No model, controller, or candidate branch may authorize its own policy promotion.",
    "No validation gate may be silently skipped, reduced, or converted into a warning.",
    "No absent metric may be recorded as zero.",
    "No broad production claim may be generated from hermetic fixtures.",
    "No efficiency promotion may occur without paired live or reproducible measured evidence.",
    "No large model may be invoked merely because it is available."
  ],
