    "Token and compute claims use measured evidence.",
    "Efficiency includes audit and verification overhead.",
    "Safety hard gates remain zero.",
    "Candidate changes have a promotion or honest non-promotion decision.",
    "The final report names residual gaps without creating automatic expansion tasks.",
    "Current-head tests and package contracts pass.",
